==Trivia==
* Eight casters participated in an FFA showmatch, played between the semifinals and the grand final. The map was "The Hunters" with the mod "FFA mod by KingCobra". The mod adds an additional win condition: a player can win by keeping at least one unit in a zone in the center of the map for one minute. RotterdaM won using this condition, with an observer being the deciding unit.

