**All the other matches are {{abbr/Bo5}}.
***Top 4 players of each group advance to the Playoffs.
===Playoffs===
*Single-elimination bracket:
**Quarterfinals are {{abbr/Bo5}}.
**Semifinals are {{abbr/Bo7}}.
**Finals are {{abbr/Bo9}}.
